      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且大家进来都会看到茶座在这里当店员。\n你有对这件事感到惊讶吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "16a66278280f9e103853f24fdacb9406cee4bf462238e82d49eeef4b9cd50e33",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
